  "content": "<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">加入我們的 <span style=\"color:#339;font-size:24px\"><strong>Discord</strong></span> 獲取 <strong>更新進度與點子分享！</strong></span></pre><p><span style=\"color:#339;font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#339\" href=\"https://discord.gg/4ebsS4R2hN\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt;Discord 連結</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hostile-delight/settings/f\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/896557/description_3ad55eca-d1ef-458b-af86-a93e3dc0d378.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"766\" height=\"124\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#808000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#808000\"><span style=\"color:#9c0\">農夫樂事<span style=\"color:#008000\"> </span></span>擴充模組</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組是 <span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:24px\"><strong>農夫樂事擴充套件</strong></span>，使用<span style=\"color:#930;font-size:24px\"> <strong>來自原版與模組怪物的掉落素材</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">來製作各式各樣的<strong>料理</strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#008080\"><strong>深海守衛壽司</strong></span>？<span style=\"color:#396\"> <strong>煎烏龜蛋</strong></span>？<span style=\"color:#330\"> <strong>腐肉培根</strong></span>？</span> 透過本模組都能享用。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組新增<strong>數十種食物</strong>、物品與效果！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組目前仍處於<strong>開發階段</strong>，敬請期待！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#9cf;font-size:24px\"><strong>獨特功能</strong></span>：採集歌萊蜂蜜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">對歌萊花使用玻璃瓶可獲得 <span style=\"color:#c9f;font-size:24px\"><strong>歌萊蜂蜜瓶！</strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>附註：我是韓國人，英文能力不太好 :(</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:8px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/CrescentStudio117\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://patreon.com/CrescentStudio117</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#36f\"><strong><span>常見問答：</span></strong></span></p><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:24px\"><strong>問：</strong></span>是否有計畫在模組中加入（動物名稱）的<span style=\"color:#fc9\"><strong>肉類</strong></span>？<br><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>答：</strong></span></span><span>我<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>不打算</strong></span>在模組中加入<span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>現實動物的肉類</strong></span>，因為我認為這不符合模組的設計理念。</span></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（例外：蝙蝠、蜘蛛等）包含<strong><span style=\"color:#808000\">村民</span></strong>/<strong><span style=\"color:#808080\">災厄村民</span></strong>的肉類也是如此。</span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">問</span>：</span></strong></span><span>能否為（奇幻生物名稱）添加肉類？<br></span><span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>答：</strong></span>當然可以！</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>歡迎提供點子！</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><br><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:24px\"><strong>問：</strong></span>是否計畫為奇幻<strong>模組生物</strong>添加食物（例如<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0\">Alex's Mobs</span></strong></span>）？<br><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>答：</strong></span></span><span>尚未確定，但後續當我<strong>耗盡原版生物的料理靈感</strong>時，可能會考慮將部分模組設為可選依賴並<strong>為其製作食物</strong>。</span></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>（目前正在為 Alex's Mobs 和 Ice and Fire:Dragons 製作兼容內容。其他模組兼容請期待後續更新！）<br><br></strong></span></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong><span>若在無關場合使用本模組材質，我們將不經警告直接採取法律行動。</span></strong></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br><br></strong></span><br></span></pre>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
